# ReactAdmin Charts & Tables

## Charts

- Admin dashboards use **Recharts** (`ResponsiveContainer`, `LineChart`, `PieChart` donut).
- Hub HomeDashboard visual recipe: KPI row → insights strip → line + donut → optional progress.
- Token colors: `var(--foreground)`, `var(--teal)`, `var(--destructive)`, `var(--border)`, muted ticks.
- Freight labels (shipments, clearance, warehouse) — not CRM invoices/contacts.
- **Do not add ApexCharts** unless product explicitly requests it (hub screenshot was Recharts).

Mock series: [`veyra-demo.ts`](../../reactadmin/src/lib/demo.ts). Dashboard UI: [`overview-dashboard.tsx`](../../reactadmin/src/components/admin/overview-dashboard.tsx).

## Tables

- Shared markup: `Table` / `TableHeader` / `TableBody` / `TableRow` / `TableHead` / `TableCell`
- Uppercase muted column headers; link IDs to detail
- **One stack only:** when server lists arrive, use **TanStack Table** — do not dual-build Acensure’s client `DataTable` + TanStack systems
- List chrome (search/filters/Sheet CTA): see [list-workspace.mdc](./list-workspace.mdc)
